fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.6952097Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.6960798Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7045815Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7054817Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7055398Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7056277Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7056760Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7057523Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7058338Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7058900Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7059409Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7060222Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7060608Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7061183Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7061835Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7062474Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7062903Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7063095Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7063337Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7063652Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7064066Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7064545Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7064709Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7064831Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7065023Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7065397Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7065956Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7066367Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7066611Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7066986Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7067187Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7067578Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7067966Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7068334Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7068593Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7068870Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7069196Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7069529Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7083002Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7083630Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7093704Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7094459Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7094770Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7095989Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7096486Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
