fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7113073Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7122851Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7123739Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7124580Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-02T11:08:34.7124991Z 
